    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose ina kumiít axweesanto dír múk Israeli sleémeero, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inooín giri báy, «Aníng hám daxta kureeri ngi koom a tsiiru nee mibeeri tsár, nee /uuruú nir gadiyuus daxta aa faák. Slám AAKOÓ MUNGÚ iga báy, ‹Kuúng yaaér Yordani a waarahhká.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng inósuú kilá' nun geerahaar nee mukdá' baraadá' hoót guri hhaamiis, as yaamuudá' kiwa ala'. Yoshua sleeme kuungá' nun geerahaar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngira oó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ múk baraá yaamuudá' gun hhaamiis adoodá' aa tleéhh dír waawutmo Sihoni nee Ogu, waawituú múk Amori, qoomár yaamuuín ngiwa hhaamiís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kuungá' nu baalír i haniis, nee adoodá' naa báw ka dir'ín i tlehhá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' /atlé', nee munehhe'eesé'. Mada'ayumiitaara', laqaá munduwa dae tlaaqiyé'. Asma AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng nee kuungá' tin alkoondá', inós i surukiiká dirhunge nee nu geexayká.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Mose Yoshua guri ateét dír geeraá múk Israeli, guri báy, «Gám piíhh, nee ilakaahareés, asma kuúng nee mukwí un geerahát ay baraá yaamuudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa lo'ór wa /aáy ngiwa haniisi dír baabi'iihúng, nee kuúng ki baraadií dahás ngiwa aaliya'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kuungá' nun geerahaar. Inós nee kuungá' a dinkwa. Inós i surukiiká dirhunge, laqaá nu geexayká. Mada'ayumiitaara', laqaá ma amoqwaqwadimara'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose dabeedá' gana gooín, gari haniís dír kaahamuusér Mungú ar tlahhoó Laáwi, kudá' sandakmoó alqadór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ loohiisá', nee dír bariise sleémeero ar múk Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose inooín giri báy, «Umuú kurkú faanqwe, qoomaadá' taa qaás as múk lawaale gwedit deelór ur ar isleeri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "qoomár múk Israeli sleémeero birna hardáh dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng didá' handá' inós aa tsawaár, kuúng dabeerí soomuseek dir geeraá múk Israeli sleémeero wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muu sleémeero dinkwárí burumbureek, hhawaate nee /ameenaaro nee na/iiwo, dinkwa nee hoomár baraá gixsaduuhúng wa hoota, as kahhó' ngiwa axaasiya' nee ngiwa intsaatsahhiya' nee AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng nguwa ilaiwawa/iya', nee axweesanoó dabeerí nguwa harmagaahhiya' ooharo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee as na/ii'ín kudá' aáng ngi xua'aaká ngiwa axaasiya' nee ngiwa intsaatsaahhiya', nee AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng nguwa ilaiwawa/iya' qooma sleémeero ar tawa hota' baraá yaamuudá' ta aalír eera', yaamuudaá gayuú yaaér Yordani.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Mose guri báy, «Deeloorók ar tawa kahhut naa tseewuúr. Yoshua ateteek, hardaharé' baraá heémár Mungú as nguwa kaangwí baw.» Mose nee Yoshua tari tláy ay dír heémár Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee AAKOÓ MUNGÚ giri baraadií harati'iít, ar baraá uhmoó huunki kudá' aa sihhiit dír afkú heémaadár Mungú.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose guri báy, «Kuúng daxta deeloorók ar tawa kahhut naa tseewuúr, nee alaá bara gwá', muu aníng i geexáy, nee munguaá hatlá' kiri eehaar awa baraá yaamuudá' tay hotaá ay. Aníng i geexayá', nee alqador'eé' ngiri geexayá', tidá' nee inooín taa tleehhaán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalaadae aníng inooín ngiri i daa/atúw buhhtaawo, aníng ngiri geexáw, ngiri alaá xu'ús, inooín kiri hhaamiis. Slahh'amaayér yaariir giri sleér, nee ngiri tsaahhiyá' adór gár slahh'amuudá' ngusa slayé' a as Munguúín tawa dinkwaarooká nee inooín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baldae looeemaawo aníng inooín in alaá xu'us asma tlakweemaaká yaariir naa tleehhiyé', nee munguaá hatlá' ngiwa i warqayé'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gimáy daxta, daa'angwí gooimeek, nee múk Israeli ku intsaahhatís! Daa'angwí qaaseek gawaá afer'ín, daa'angwí i lamabu'uungw tleehhiti dír múk Israeliwo as daanduueé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma qoomár aníng inooín bira huúw baraá yaamaá diihhooár ilwa nee dane, kudá' aníng naa lo'ór wa /aáy ngiwa haniis dír baabi'ii'ín, ala inooín tan /ayín, nee tan aax, tari wahhadiit. Aluuwo inooín tari warqáy, munguaá hatlá' kiri haratlintii', aníng iri si'iyá' nee alqador'eé' ngiri geexayá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár slahh'amaaye birnga sleér, daa'angwí gi inslawtis as tawa lamabu'uungw, asma gunqarutaro daa'angwí i ya/anká dír afér na/ii'íne. Asma aníng gár inooín ta qoomeemesi a xuú' dír aníng inooín ngira huwiiká baraá yaamuudá' naa lo'ór wa /aáy ngiwa dir'íní haniis.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy baalaadár kilae Mose daa'angwí guri gooín, nee múk Israeli guri intsaahhatís.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
