            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár Mose /aymi'iikaá dabeerí gooiro ngiwa hhe'eés, iimír iimu/úngw wa ale ay /aymuú alhhe'eesáy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "múk tlahhoó Laáwi kudá' sandakmoó alqadór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ loohiís, guri báy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Kitaábuuwí oo dabe taatahhaak, ku qasá' bihhaá sandakmooduú alqadór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng. Masók i didá' wa hoot, as tawa lamabu'uungw daanduuhunge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng a xuú' adór kuungá' tar múk sage gawdén nee oo aa dee/anuut. Hamí qoomár aníng niwa slaaf kuungá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ugwa ahhé', xáy, daqaní ma meerá' qoomár aníng bara gwaá'! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gimsé', bariisér tlahhi'iihúng burumburaare', nee geeraharuuseero, as aníng kaangwí nguwa oo' baraá iiaaín, nee aníng doori nee yaamu in ateét ngiwa lamabu'una'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma aníng a xuú' alaá gwa'arar'eene kuungá' a tsuwa hhitrumitá', nee loohidá' naa hara'ayiím kari geexeerá'. Nee de'emaá hi'iita'a kuungá' amotlakwe nu sleér, asma kuungá' tlakweema i tlehhá' dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGUHE, inós kuri mune duxá' ar muruudá' kuungá' dabaahunge ta tlehhita'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
